## Anatomy

```svelte
<Outline.Root>
	<Outline.Tree>
		{#snippet empty()}No bookmarks{/snippet}
	</Outline.Tree>
</Outline.Root>
```

## Usage

Items get `data-active` (the section being read) and `data-contains-active`; `outline.activePath` gives a breadcrumb. Clicking navigates with history, so Back returns. For papers without bookmarks, use [Toc](/components/toc), which falls back to headings found in the text.

